  noteTitle: 'Office Memos 3/4 Exit Lockdown Protocol:'
  noteContent: The emergency lockdown protocol can be activated remotely or locally.
    To deactivate the full lockdown of the main exit doors and restore standard functionality,
    access to the Main Control Panel is required. This panel is located in the Dean's
    Office. Access to the panel requires the Dean's Access Card.
